    <briefdescription>
<para>A base class representing a named entity in the simulation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An <ref refid="classostk_1_1simulation_1_1_entity" kindref="compound">Entity</ref> has an identifier and a name. It serves as the base class for Components and other simulation objects.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classostk_1_1simulation_1_1_entity_1a929819736161db5935b29b84da8a97aa" kindref="member">Entity</ref><sp/>entity(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my-entity&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>String&amp;<sp/>name<sp/>=<sp/>entity.getName();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>String&amp;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">id</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>=<sp/>entity.getId();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
